        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although it fluctuates, we can have up to one quarter of our research and development engineers assigned to one or more projects, partnered with solution services engineers, in a deliberate strategy to provide direct feedback between technology development and customer needs.",
